MODULE status_2000 OUTPUT.

  SET PF-STATUS '2000'.
  SET TITLEBAR  '2000'.

  IF go_grid IS INITIAL.
    PERFORM create_alv.
  ENDIF.

ENDMODULE.

*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Module STATUS_3000 OUTPUT
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
MODULE status_3000 OUTPUT.
  SET PF-STATUS '3000'.
  SET TITLEBAR  '3000'.

* 결산유형 드롭다운
  PERFORM set_close_type_list.

* 항목 ALV 최초 생성
  IF go_item_grid IS INITIAL.
    PERFORM create_item_alv.
  ENDIF.

ENDMODULE.
